{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Hey Bill 是一款本機優先的記帳工具，適合想以自然語言快速記錄開支、並重視私隱的用戶。原價 US $0.99，現時<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>，可於 App Store 下載。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-220.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>自然語言快速記帳</h2>\n<p>Hey Bill 可連接 Claude 或 ChatGPT，讓你用自然語言記錄開支，或把收據整理成總額與逐項明細。助理只可新增記錄，不能讀取、修改或刪除帳本。App 提供日、週、月、年圖表、分類分析、每月預算進度，以及原幣記錄與獨立預算，方便掌握消費狀況。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-210-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-211-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-212-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-213-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-214-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-215-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Hey Bill</li><li>應用類別：Finance</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/hey-bill/id6758043507?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T00:24:09.632497+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":264,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T00:05:50+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T14:57:35.836334+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T00:17:28.346361+00:00","content_hash":"f5d74f67af78350b7757e63941d0a9fc3865b15217ff2388237a7cc27dfcfd46","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}